# Agent cold-start routing

Before nontrivial implementation or audit work: (1) Read `AGENTS.md`. (2) Bootstrap via `mm_get_agent_bootstrap` or `mm_read_project_doc(agentBootstrap)` or `project-knowledge/generated/indexes/agent-bootstrap.json`. (3) Read `project-knowledge/CURRENT_STATE.md`. (4) Load only one task-specific canonical document. (5) Treat Live/Partial/Mocked/Planned literally. (6) If MCP unavailable, use those file paths. (7) State which canonical sources informed the plan. No doctrine here. Optional: `npm run agent:preflight -- --workflow <id>`.
